roup is promoted two groups, the second is promoted one group, and the seventh and eighth are relegated two groups; the first in the Challenger group is promoted two groups, and the second and third are promoted one group. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Alliance Group Rules </> \n Clubs ranked after the Traveler group will be divided into the <Highlight> Challenger group </> (top eight) and subsequent <Highlight> Alliance groups </> (<Highlight> Alliance groups do not participate in promotion or relegation </>) based on the <Highlight> total club Потусторонний score </>. Clubs in the Alliance group will <Highlight> automatically match </> with other clubs to form an alliance before each league starts, participating in the Four-Way League as an alliance. <Highlight> All club members </> in the alliance can enter the battle, and the <Highlight> president of the highest-ranked club </> in the alliance will automatically obtain <Highlight> league command authority </> in the match. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Season Reset </> \n At the start of each new season, the league will <Highlight> re-divide regions </>, and opponents will be re-matched to build new regions based on <Highlight> the previous season's league results </>. \n",
